EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}There you are, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}} I need
your help with something important.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Please just follow me!

{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Welcome to your surprise party,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Now make a wish, and blow out the
candles on your birthday cake!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Bienvenid{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} a tu fiesta sorpresa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Ahora tienes que pedir un deseo
y soplar las velas del pastel!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Sürpriz partine hoş geldin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Şimdi bir dilek tut ve doğum
günü pastandaki mumları üfle!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Espera,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} no te vayas todavía!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Me daría mucha pena si no soplaras
las velas ni probaras el pastel{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Aspetta,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} non scappare via così!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Spegni almeno le candeline
prima di andartene.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Warte,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} bitte geh noch nicht weg!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Blas erst deine Kerzen aus und iss
ein Stück Kuchen, ja?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡No te vayas, cariño!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Que tenemos
pastel y regalos para ti!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Al menos sopla las velitas{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Wir haben dir etwas besonders
Schönes besorgt, weil wir dich alle
so gernhaben, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
Wenn's dir nicht gefällt, dann...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dann wären wir schon traurig.{{TAG:0003:0018:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}J'espère que tu t'es bien amus{{TAG:000E:0006:0200E9000400E9006500}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vivement l'année prochaine qu'on
refasse la fête,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Se non riesci a spegnere tutte
le candeline, non preoccuparti:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
abbiamo un estintore.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}We baked this cake especially for
you.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Are you ready to make a wish,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0000:}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bu pastayı özellikle senin için yaptık.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir dilek tutmaya hazır
mısın,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Geriye yalnızca mumları üflemek kaldı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tek nefeste yapabilir misin? {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Nintendo
3DS{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}’ine üfle.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} FUUUV!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}What did you wish for, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
If you tell me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I promise not to tell
the birthday-wish committee.
But I will tell everyone else in town
so we can help make it come true!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Will you share it with me?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
OK. It's...
It's a secret!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Qué deseo has pedido,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Si me lo cuentas,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} entre todos
podemos hacerlo realidad!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Pues...
¡Es secreto!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ne diledin, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Bana söylersen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
doğum günü dilek komitesine
söylemeyeceğime söz veririm.
Ama gerçekleşmesine yardım edebilelim diye
kasabadaki diğer herkese söylerim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Benimle paylaşır mısın?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Tamam. Dileğim...
Sır.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0012:0014:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Na, da werde ich mich anstrengen
müssen, damit das in Erfüllung geht!
